Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.02,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,One bronze piece for a job payment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That basically means working for free,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.11,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but a surprising amount of \Nadventurers will take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.11,0:00:18.79,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,We're not doing this just for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:21.48,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sometimes, we'll take jobs to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:26.39,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, the guild wouldn't \Ntake a job request like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.80,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,"Defeat the Legendary Lord of the Lake."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.58,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Any jobs catch your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.41,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheila?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:37.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not going into the Labyrinth \Nfor a while, just like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:43.06,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I thought I could help \Nif you were looking for a quick job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:47.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is nobody going to take this quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:51.32,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Oh, the one with the single\Nbronze piece reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.20,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's a guild tradition, so everyone \Nat least thinks about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.20,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But it's pretty difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Gathering a Dragonblood Flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.79,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:05.41,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They only bloom next to poisonous swamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:07.95,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The story about them is \Nso wonderful, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:11.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A dragon fell in love with a human woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:16.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,His blood became a bright red flower \Ncalled the Dragonblood Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:19.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A rather gruesome story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.51,0:01:25.32,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Girls who receive that flower \Nare said to be loved forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:28.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I have heard that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:31.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But for this job, they want \Nit as medicine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:36.06,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes. It's a job from the \Nchildren at an orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:40.45,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They say they need the Dragonblood Flower \Nto save someone they care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:45.08,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:23.68,Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H313136&\3c&HD2D3D4&\b1\pos(488.771,48.517)}Dragonblood \NFlower
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So this is the place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's more run-down than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.22,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.65,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I might be able to use the fluids \Nfrom that slime to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.67,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, that kind of worked...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.43,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:52.52,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Headmistress \NLillian isn't in right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.25,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,You'll have to come back another time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:59.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm an adventurer. I took \Nthe job at the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.73,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Oh, I was sure you were a debt collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:05.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:07.03,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.84,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,It's a little cramped, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.65,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Everyone, be on your best behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.93,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,He's an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.24,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Wow, you're an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:24.43,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Is that sword real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:25.83,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Are you strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.65,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:32.62,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Hey! I told you all that adventurers \Nare dangerous barbarians,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.95,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,so you needed to stay away from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.61,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.43,0:04:39.28,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:41.86,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I didn't mean you specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:44.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, it actually makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Adventurers can be the rowdy sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:50.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's only natural to be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:54.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:58.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You need to stay away from \Nweird-looking adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:00.24,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:03.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,They seem like good kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:05.38,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It can be dangerous to be too trusting,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:11.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,but it just shows they've \Nhad a happy upbringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:15.14,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes! Headmistress Lillian is a great woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:18.34,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I mean, a wonderful lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:20.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can speak normally around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:22.18,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:25.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You should be more polite \Naround adults, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.39,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.30,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,You won't get mad later?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:32.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,My name is Rentt Vivie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:34.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm a Bronze-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:40.48,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Bronze? I was sure the best \Nwe'd get was an Iron-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You know a lot about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Did you make the request?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:46.73,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes. My name is Alize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:50.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Then Alize, let's talk about the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Dragonblood Flowers aren't easy to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.41,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:58.86,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,You can barely find them at any stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:01.19,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,And even if you do, they're very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But you need one anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.39,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:07.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:10.71,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,All right. But you'll need to keep our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:17.34,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't get out \Nof bed to welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:23.99,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,My name is Lillian June. I'm a priestess \Nof the Eastern Sky Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:26.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm Rentt Vivie. An adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:31.07,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're helping to clean \Nout the orphanage's basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.15,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,even though we can only \Npay such a small amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:35.48,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Thank you, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:37.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:41.30,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,The basement is small, but \Nmonsters do appear down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.89,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,so I can't have the children doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.79,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Rest, Headmistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:49.52,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I'll tell him the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:52.00,Main,Lilian,0,0,0,,Thank you, Alize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:07:00.71,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Her disease is called Malaccumula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:03.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Malaccumula?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:04.27,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:07.33,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,She's a divinity user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:10.46,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,But if your divinity isn't strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:15.28,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,each time you use it there's a reaction that \Ncauses evil energy to accumulate in the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:19.46,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,It won't kill her anytime soon, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:25.75,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,We had a healer look at \Nher, so it has to be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:31.42,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,The only way to heal it is with the blood \Nof a holy maiden, or a special medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:32.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:38.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And you need the Dragonblood Flower \Nto make this special medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.47,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:42.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,She doesn't know what her \Ndisease is, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:43.92,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,She doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:50.27,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,If she knew, she'd have another \Npriestess take over the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And then she'd leave the orphanage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:57.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,and accept the disease \Nas the will of heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:04.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, we'll need to get the Dragonblood \NFlower before that happens, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.55,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I was sure nobody would take the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:09.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:15.52,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,But if that happened, I was going to become \Nan adventurer and go get it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:19.37,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I've got a little bit of mana, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:23.18,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But you don't have time to learn \Nhow to be an adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:27.64,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,I can really ask you to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll get it for you. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.95,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:39.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll clean up that basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You don't need to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:57.57,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,No, you're fighting monsters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:00.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't think it's that fun to watch, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:04.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can't use a sword \Nin a room this cramped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:07.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Take it, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:08.46,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Looks like they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:13.62,Main,Alize,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:20.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Pretty big, for a puchi suri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:46.15,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It changed color?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:47.90,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.93,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:51.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Spin around three times in a circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:05.29,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, what's that chubby little \Nblack rat on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:08.42,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It joined my party in the \Norphanage's basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're skipping a lot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:17.30,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Vampires have the power to \Nmake and control familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:19.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could do \Nthe same thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:21.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I guess I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:24.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,True. I hadn't actually done any \Nexperiments to see what would happen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:26.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,if I gave your blood to \Nanother creature yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.34,0:10:28.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can I keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.68,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Sure, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:33.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,We've already got an undead living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:37.58,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A rat or two won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:40.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He'll have to pay rent, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:42.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:45.16,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I want samples of his blood and hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.88,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's a lot I want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:51.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And I also want to do an ecology study.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:53.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What do you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.85,0:10:59.08,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see. Just like your dad, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.64,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I guess my blood is quite popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you going to call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Blackie, 'cause he's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You could put a little more thought into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.77,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll name him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:15.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,How about "Edel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,An excellent name, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:21.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It means "Noble One" in the ancient tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:25.40,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I heard you were the leader \Nof the other puchi suri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,He seems satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can communicate with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't speak his language, but I \Ncan kinda tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:36.16,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,From now on, then, you're Edel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:38.63,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And I'm the one who named you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:42.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm your master, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:53.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Since I became an undead, I stopped \Nneeding sleep almost entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.11,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I thought about never leaving the labyrinth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:12:00.94,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,but people would get suspicious of an \Nadventurer that never took any rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.53,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,These hours are so incredibly boring...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're leaving early in the morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:18.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Why not fill your belly, first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:23.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's a sign it'll snow today...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:25.59,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.54,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I can cook too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:34.98,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then you know how dangerous the \NTarasque Swamp is too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,How did you know where I'm going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:40.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:41.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:45.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's the only swamp around here where \Nyou can find a Dragonblood Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:46.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:48.88,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you going alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:52.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I go alone, I won't have \Nto worry about the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There's Tarasque there. A type of wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:57.34,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even Bronze-class adventurers \Nwould take a party to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:58.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not going to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:00.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:02.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I bought this for cheap at a roadside stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:04.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Holy water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:10.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes, they do say you can keep Tarasque \Naway by using holy water, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:12.09,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It doesn't always work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:14.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:17.15,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Listen, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It would be a waste to let this get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:20.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll eat it while it's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:28.47,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.47,0:13:32.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I haven't enjoyed normal food \Nthis much in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:36.36,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I put a drop of my blood in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:46.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll make you another \Nbatch when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:58.83,Main,Man,0,0,0,,We're here, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:13:59.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.87,Main,Man,0,0,0,,This is as far as I can take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.66,Main,Man,0,0,0,,I'll come and get you this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:11.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The poison doesn't bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:24.51,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I can purify it with \Nmy divinity if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:25.79,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.70,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The Tarasque Swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:32.62,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It has another name, but nobody uses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:37.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There are rare animals and plants \Nthat can only be found here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.74,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,so it's been made at least passable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:44.85,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to stick their \Nfoot into a poison swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:56.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Monsters found in the wild are stronger \Nthan the ones in the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.26,0:15:00.88,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's because they use weapons, \Nor know how to fight in groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They're tough opponents, but \Nnow I'm strong enough to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.06,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Easily defeat a few goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:18.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Next time, you work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:24.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You don't think that you're the master \Nin this relationship, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:33.14,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It sure is handy being undead, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.92,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have poison resistance, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.62,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I could just do something \Nabout my appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.03,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I might be willing to \Nstay like this forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:41.75,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I could probably never get married, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:48.65,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,He jumped and let me fall, the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:55.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've got some horrible luck today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.99,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't let my guard down for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:17.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are all vampire familiars like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:20.74,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:24.10,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You liked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.36,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt certainly enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.92,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But isn't Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:32.64,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I mixed my blood in with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:36.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Just in his portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:43.44,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm surprised the guild's already \Naware of what happened at Tottsu village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:46.46,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,We had to help transport the criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:51.32,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The villagers were very grateful \Nto the adventurer who helped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:56.31,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They refused to say his name no matter \Nhow many times we asked, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:58.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So you came to talk to him directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:02.03,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I assume he wouldn't want to \Ntalk about it at the guild...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:06.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Knowing Rentt, he assumed that even \Nif he was the hero of that story,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:10.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,any association of him and the word "kidnapping"\Nwould just make people more suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:14.23,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He can sometimes do things \Nyou'd never expect him to,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:16.56,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,but he does know how to \Nthink things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.86,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You know him well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've known him a long time, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:25.79,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Then do you know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:26.72,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:32.85,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Why becoming a Mythril-class \Nadventurer is so important to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:42.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've never heard him talk \Nabout that, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:44.51,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:49.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've been told that adventurers don't \Nask each other about their pasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:52.09,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Part of it is that I don't \Nwant to get too nosy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:55.05,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,you know how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.51,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You don't worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:18:01.64,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Even with the job he's on today... \Nhe might have to fight a Tarasque.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.99,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What a strange thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:07.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The guild puts a lot of work into \Nmaking sure adventurers only take jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:08.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,appropriate for their strength, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.89,0:18:14.59,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Of course. We judged him strong enough \Nfor the task before giving it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.59,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:21.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll defer to the opinion of \Nour talented guild staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.19,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And what's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:27.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even if something does happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:30.91,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,an adventurer always finds a way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:36.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Damn it! I should've known that \Nholy water was too cheap to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:39.89,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A dead end...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:44.98,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll have to fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:58.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:18:59.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Poison won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:05.21,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't think I can defeat you \Nwith just my mana, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:19.16,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It didn't work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.33,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Edel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:33.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Is that divinity? Is he using my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:38.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Edel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:49.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't use my divinity without my okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That did give me a good hint, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:38.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see. A Tarasque's \Nweakness is divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:42.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. You helped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:48.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I can't field dress it here. \NNot when it's this big...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:07.07,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've got bad luck. That's \None thing I'm sure of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.94,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was pretty sure I'd have \Nto fight a Tarasque.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:15.21,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, though,\NI've learned how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:19.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can find a lot of rare materials here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:20.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:34.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Are these all Dragonblood flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:39.19,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Their power is purifying this whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:44.48,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's safe to take a few more \Nthan I came for, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:57.58,Main,Isaac,0,0,0,,Oh my. I'm surprised to \Nsee someone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:39.85,Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(117.604,267.001)}A Strange Man and a Strange Job
